units metal
dimension 3
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
read_data structures/base_active_local_relaxed.data
create_atoms 4 single 9.9573898076 24.2578814220 60.0 units box
include potentials/potential_stage69.inc
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
region fixed_region block INF INF INF INF -10.0 8.0 units box
region sink_region block INF INF INF INF 8.0 18.0 units box
region crater_region cylinder z 9.9573898076 24.2578814220 8.0 12.0 100.0 units box
group substrate id 1:4305
group projectile id 4306
group fixed region fixed_region
group sink region sink_region
group mobile subtract all fixed
group crater region crater_region
group freezone intersect mobile crater
group free_substrate subtract freezone projectile
group anchored subtract mobile freezone
group bath subtract sink freezone
velocity substrate create 300.0 977302 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
velocity fixed set 0.0 0.0 0.0
velocity projectile set 0.0 0.0 -105.3164
fix hold fixed setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
fix integrate all nve
fix anchor anchored spring/self 100.0
fix_modify anchor energy yes
fix bathfix bath langevin 300.0 300.0 0.05 551030 zero yes tally yes
compute Tfree free_substrate temp
compute Tmobile mobile temp
timestep 0.00002
thermo 500
thermo_style custom step time atoms c_Tfree c_Tmobile pe ke etotal f_bathfix
thermo_modify flush yes
dump tr all custom 500 dumps/impact_01_62eV.dump id type x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz
dump_modify tr sort id
run 9000
undump tr
write_data structures/impact_01_62eV.data
write_restart restart/impact_01_62eV.restart
